  "details": "When playing on Steam Deck, the new Desktop Camera cannot be controlled using the provided bindings.\nThe inputs for move self, fly camera, and take photo (outside of using the timed 5s photo) do not function. \nThe UI icons also show mouse inputs, which does not comply with the Steam Deck Verified program.\nVideo demonstration: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1013949069502201996/GameCapture_2022-08-29_19-10-01.mp4",
